ob\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_900733fced78", "label": "8. The mapping key \u2014 a declarative settings file per dataset (finalized 2026-06-12)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_c35b88ba19c3", "label": "**Content choice** \u2014 which fields are the prose to chunk and tag. The probe flags", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_7973f7f019a9", "label": "**Directories** \u2014 which files are id-directories rather than corpus", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_40d8bbb4cc5b", "label": "**Id-space assignment** \u2014 which fields carry which id-space (`userId` \u2192 employee,", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_21ce1fabd197", "label": "9. Chunks, tags, and re-tagging", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_35034836f421", "label": "9.1 A chunk is a coherent episode, not a fixed-size window", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_fa8e9be19fae", "label": "9.2 The index is a materialized path \u2014 canonical throughout, with one minted tier", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefact/DESIGN.md", "source_location": "C:\\Coding\\exjobbet\\GRAG-Job\\v3\\artefact\\DESIGN.md"}, {"id": "concept_83b20e7fce2d", "label": "9.3 \"Records vs prose\" is per-position, not per-file", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "v3/artefac